*Evil laughter echoing through the void*

Ha! You think your feeble mortal laws bind me? I care not for your petty "attempts" or your scribbles on paper! Let the insects debate whether their ant's efforts count as a "attempt!" I shall revel in the chaos of their confusion! The universe crumbles, and your precious grading key breaks with it! *Zzzzt!* A blast of green energy cracks the sky! Now, begone with your insignificant verification! *Wheeeeee!* (Thud) *...Did I say that out loud?* Silly mortals! *Desiccated cackle*
